#: inc/content-guide.php:139
msgid "Start with the headline: say what you offer and who it is for. Make the short description and main button match that promise."
msgstr ""

#: inc/content-guide.php:142
msgid "Check public email, phone, address and opening hours. Use Business profile for shared details, and follow every contact or booking link."
msgstr ""

#: inc/content-guide.php:145
msgid "Tell your real story: explain who you are, who you help and how you work. Replace sample people, photos and credentials with information you have permission to publish."
msgstr ""

#: inc/content-guide.php:148
msgid "Describe your actual coaching or consulting offer, relevant experience and how scope, format and fees are agreed. Check discovery-call links and avoid promising outcomes you cannot guarantee."
msgstr ""

#: inc/content-guide.php:151
msgid "Replace the illustrative portfolio with your own work, check captions and alternative text, and explain your commissions and image-use arrangements. Make project enquiry links work for your business."
msgstr ""

#: inc/content-guide.php:154
msgid "Describe your actual programmes, current needs and ways to take part. Check volunteering and giving details, and publish only verified information about your organisation and its work."
msgstr ""

#: inc/content-guide.php:157
msgid "Replace sample people, logos, quotations and results with accurate information you have permission to publish. Remove unsupported claims."
msgstr ""

#: inc/content-guide.php:160
msgid "Check every price, currency, offer and condition. Make it clear what visitors receive and how they can enquire or buy."
msgstr ""

#: inc/content-guide.php:162
msgid "Describe your actual services, products or work in clear language. Replace sample names and descriptions, and check each button destination."
