#: patterns/fitness-faq.php:28
#: patterns/fitness-faq.php:29
msgctxt "FAQ question"
msgid "I have never lifted before. Where do I start?"
msgstr ""

#: patterns/fitness-faq.php:31
msgctxt "FAQ answer"
msgid "With the free session. A coach walks you through the four main lifts using an empty bar, and you leave with a plan for your first month. Roughly half the people in any class started exactly this way."
msgstr ""

#: patterns/fitness-faq.php:35
#: patterns/fitness-faq.php:36
msgctxt "FAQ question"
msgid "Do I have to book, or can I turn up?"
msgstr ""

#: patterns/fitness-faq.php:38
msgctxt "FAQ answer"
msgid "Book. Classes cap at twelve and the 18:30 slots fill by Sunday night. Booking opens seven days ahead in the app, and cancelling before midday costs you nothing."
msgstr ""

#: patterns/fitness-faq.php:42
#: patterns/fitness-faq.php:43
msgctxt "FAQ question"
msgid "Can I pause my membership?"
msgstr ""

#: patterns/fitness-faq.php:45
msgctxt "FAQ answer"
msgid "Yes — up to two months a year for any reason at all, and longer for injury, pregnancy or a spell working away. Email the studio; there is no form and no retention call."
msgstr ""

#: patterns/fitness-faq.php:49
#: patterns/fitness-faq.php:50
msgctxt "FAQ question"
msgid "Is there parking, and are there showers?"
msgstr ""

#: patterns/fitness-faq.php:52
msgctxt "FAQ answer"
msgid "Eighteen free spaces at the rear, plus bike racks inside the door. Four showers in each changing room, towels included, and lockers that do not need a pound coin."
msgstr ""

